{
  "_comment": [
    "Capability types, topics and weather parameters.",
    "",
    "The 'capabilities' table is load-bearing: @type is a function of the",
    "CATEGORY of the passage, not of the document. One agromet bulletin therefore",
    "publishes several capability types, and each type carries only the attribute",
    "groups it is for -- a crop resource has agricultureSubjects and no",
    "weatherParameters; a forecast resource the reverse. validate.py fails a",
    "payload where the two disagree, which is what stops a resource from",
    "advertising a capability it has no data for."
  ],
